# Build input: the raw Claude Design export. Each file carries every font and
# image again as base64, so committing them would put ~21MB of duplicated
# payload back into the repo that the build exists to remove. Drop a fresh
# export here when you rebuild; the first import is recoverable from history
# with `git show 79bd489:index.html`.
